      "text": "8 February: Sugarloaf Mountain and Free Time"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "87b8770f10f5f5f2db7a97e153f54964231eebd281f51fa9a33df860f332b543",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-mw9nvgw6-cx25ndvy",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After a night at the Sambadrome, the morning is free.\n\nYou can rest, have a late breakfast or explore Rio on your own.\n\nIn the afternoon, your English-speaking guide will take you to Praia Vermelha.\n\nThe first cable car takes you up Morro da Urca.\n\nThe second takes you to the summit of Sugarloaf Mountain.\n\nFrom the viewpoints you can see the bay, Copacabana, islands and mountains, and Corcovado with the Christ the Redeemer statue.\n\nDay 4 lists VIP Access / Fast Track as included for Sugarloaf Mountain, so you can skip the general queue.\n\nThe general exclusions, however, list Fast Track as excluded without further detail. Please confirm this at the time of booking.\n\nAfter the excursion, you’ll have free time."
    },
